name: Boundary context inheritance, inactive edits, exact binding and revised approval
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted
keys: Space Down Space p Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engines
keys: m Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space a Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | boundary-context
expect: Common context
expect: app · inherits common
expect: other · inherits common
ask: Does the boundary list distinguish inherited, overridden and omitted context, with common context separately accessible?
keys: Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-alpha
expect: Alpha
keys: e
require-live-snap: 20 ↑↓ Enter edit | context-editor-ready
keys: Enter C-u
type: Owned boundary context
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | edit-review
expect: Owned boundary context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Edited copy saved | inactive-copy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owned boundary context | inspected-copy
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for app | app-override
expect: app · exact override
keys: Down o
require-live-snap: 20 other · omitted | other-omitted
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | omitted-picker
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 other · omitted | cancelled-picker
ask: Can the operator edit an inactive copy for one boundary, inspect it before use, omit a sibling, and cancel inspection without changing associations or global context?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: context-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: context-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: context-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: context-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 i inherit · o omit · Esc back | context-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: context-page-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | budget-draft
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Enter save · Esc cancel | total-call-editor
type: 8
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 2
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 30 Scope draft ready | frozen-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
keys: L End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | exact-approval
expect: 6 fixed jobs
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Approval saved | approved
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
keys: Up Up Up Enter
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | frozen-context
keys: Up
require-live-snap: 20 Context actually frozen for scans | frozen-app
expect: Source identity:
keys: i
require-live-snap: 20 app · inherits common | inheritance-restored
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | changed-draft
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Scope draft ready | revised-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revised
ask: Does changing an approved override back to inheritance require a new plan while retaining allowance, explicit sibling omission and all work unstarted?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/scope-resume.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a Down Down Down Enter Down
require-live-snap: 20 SCOPE CONTEXT | recovered-app
expect: app · inherits common
expect: other · omitted
expect: Context actually frozen for scans
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 i inherit · o omit · Esc back | recovered-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-14-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-15-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-16-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-17-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: recovered-page-18-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scope_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart retain the exact associations and frozen source/context provenance in a no-color process, with readable paging and keyboard controls at 40x12?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
